d":"footnote-11152-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的季节。梁元帝","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11152-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"《采莲赋》里说得好：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“于是妖童媛女，荡舟心许","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11152-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；鹢首徐回，兼传羽杯","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11152-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；棹将移而藻挂，船欲动而萍开","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11152-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。尔其纤腰束素，迁延顾步","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11152-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；夏始春余，叶嫩花初，恐沾裳而浅笑，畏倾船而敛裾","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11152-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"可见当时嬉游的光景了。这真是有趣的事，可惜我们现在早已无福消受","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11152-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"于是又记起《西洲曲》","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11152-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"里的句子：","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"“采莲南塘秋，莲花过人头；低头弄莲子，莲子清如水。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"今晚若有采莲人，这儿的莲花也算得“过人头”了；只不见一些流水的影子，是不行的。这令我到底惦着江南了。——这样想着，猛一抬头，不觉已是自己的门前；轻轻地推门进去，什么声息也没有，妻已睡熟好久了。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"1927年7月，北京清华园","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11152-2","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-1","postId":"11152-2","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11152-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","